{"job_id":"F-1083f0f835eef9a471dd","family_id":"F-1083f0f835eef9a471dd","title":"해군교육사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"c4635fbad639036e0c5534c1ca401499509a186ba3b9ae4c433d6ead09b2be0a","source_hash":"2430dc40a469142c5f19b9541ef8166121ae067d6026ddd7a74a9086e1e046ce","text":"海军教育司令部命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":85,"target_id":"4c20584ef30cda0a0808820ad141e1e7ac4fd9ebf9b98ccadcf1ec9d977afac5","source_hash":"923fc8ac23bb03c749089fae9c279ae3786d165eaaa4352bb886281ed2aadf66","text":"第 1 条（安装和任务）\n① 在海军中设立海军教育司令部（以下简称“教育司令部”）。\n教育司令部负责海军的教育、训练和教育发展相关事宜。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":85,"end":118,"target_id":"2d088068ba4a1b324a2ae6f7679fee3e279760aa935cc24474d08ce2b421ddfc","source_hash":"a67ae6d834eb2f8be128928b5dbfb52c8b854ffb8c3e2f2580c19c72fcfe91e8","text":"第二条（地点）教育司令部的地点由海军作战部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":118,"end":295,"target_id":"431f95dd8045dbe931ef00791d0e83f1e65c4f98a33f1d734dcd1d67306aa904","source_hash":"7aef51030438d9d0255c29efa204bb7d8cba8519aa45b6e42470e930faca4931","text":"第3条（指挥官）\n①应任命一名指挥官到教育司令部。\n② 司令官由总统根据国防部长的提议，并依据海军作战部长的建议，从海军将领中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n③ 司令官在海军作战部长的命令下，监督教育司令部的运作，并指挥和监督其附属单位（包括分配给教育司令部的单位）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":295,"end":410,"target_id":"822dd8a347f527418042a5bfe14204ece61ca9a44de41a35983289d2bdde8c2d","source_hash":"f6bf28a816fc6223efca359451a494e579669104ed9eca46e13c9b5e08c75bbb","text":"제4조(참모장)\n①教育司令部应任命一名参谋长。\n② 参谋长应从海军将官或校级军官中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n③参谋长协助司令官，并在司令官的命令下协调和监督参谋事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":410,"end":454,"target_id":"1aa83c2d97a4e6167fd48d1b824f54e0a08b796f5944afb7c0a13c6c0874cbdc","source_hash":"b1e08476092af4ce2cf6c0ecdc60386d8b3eea87ddd615b7b54737dce7a1d91c","text":"第五条（代理职责）司令官缺席时，参谋长代其履行职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":454,"end":588,"target_id":"84b8347c7f4e4b70f2cfb1fb0575342f0d548d5cb7e4b788bdb8e70156f5cdc0","source_hash":"4fea0df7704662ff62bd3172f8771654321a66046d058bfad70b798545ebdd3a","text":"第六条（部门和单位的设立）\n①在教育司令部内建立必要的部门和单位。\n② 根据第1款规定，各部门的组织和职责划分的必要事项，由海军作战部长决定；各单位的设立、任务和组织的必要事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":588,"end":677,"target_id":"b502035498a7cf065653a506a50551b5b0bdf6c6851f2362f5defcd3f7cb6004","source_hash":"2d04a06f327110854526032ce9f850f2db6c02ae3e5345b92d903a7089099e6f","text":"第七条（教育司令部搬迁的事先批准）  当司令因灾害、疾病控制或军事需要而拟搬迁教育司令部时，必须事先获得海军作战部长的批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":677,"end":724,"target_id":"b282ecff857e7d44855042f889f01c1405cd8da6af7025ce57ee02cdaef848b2","source_hash":"1c1f5977e46219d56d4a6818c118b6024b9dae51484102fac4960114d70a7aa8","text":"第八条（人员配额）教育司令部应配备军人和文职人员，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":724,"end":811,"target_id":"c569bcd4e73dbaf7b61057fc512f92fe38e82b6b18d3fff446739cdde665c3ed","source_hash":"8793a4b8d2e3c3ff77105ef7428b0d75330f0d8f7cf0f807ddac20389159e7f1","text":"补充规定 <第12210号规定，1987年7月1日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（修改其他法律）《军事人员法实施令》修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":811,"end":886,"target_id":"35ac20baa5b5edb3ab64d56d3c4dac7b4378ec486e67f494bcc9af709eb4b2a3","source_hash":"573e5b51eb88efa1294c33d0223afc94cffe501806cf23406c56675ca68d1bcb","text":"第 13 条第 1 款第 2 项第 (c) 项中，“海军学院院长和第二海军学院院长”应改为“海军学院院长、第二海军学院院长和海军教育司令部司令”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":886,"end":919,"target_id":"2bbc60aa3256309fcaa3b8039f6750753caa539250b7c26ce6854b82cbbabe98","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":919,"end":956,"target_id":"4d46fa03e6783717ff1c01b70398b7cd7b6add5b5d621e7a3b1386c131b4b236","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":956,"end":970,"target_id":"7238af87097aea4e2c1ab0871e5d10bedc52d6fa94ef7615e2036233f0782a10","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第 2 条和第 3 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005535-197300-ko","scope":"BODY","start":970,"end":1120,"target_id":"5bef1965f6c1f622f90014ca4a4d1a7c2c678d2042970d98a6c241751df54ef5","source_hash":"0e7819559d5630513d91975bb1adff6d065c2834f730960407ef1d761075dcb2","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<80>款省略\n\n  <81> 海军教育司令部法令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第3条第2款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。 \n\n  第 4 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <82> 至 <90> 已省略"}]}